CHANGES:

< NUNE 0.5 > (unreleased)

The beginning of the hackage of MyNews-1.0 code.  No new features, mostly code cleanup.

< NUNE 1.0 > (unreleased)

Many new features including archiving, unique logins, better administration setup.
Pretty much everything you see now.

< NUNE 1.5 > (unreleased)

Complete re-working of code.  Old MyNews-1.0 include system thrown out in favour of a more clear
function-based system.  MyNews 1.0 is pretty much absent from the code.  Reduced configuration
files to just one (nune.conf).  Various bug fixes.

< NUNE 1.5a >

Minor date bug fixed.

< NUNE 1.5b >

The COPYING file was very screwed up (not sure why).  Replaced with real copy of the GPL.  README
file fixed up.  Nothing special.
